etter show that you have a work study award for the current academic year? Yes No * Is your cumulative and/or semester GPA a 2.5 or better? (Open Ended Question) * Are you currently seeking a degree at Missouri State University? Or are you currently seeking a teacher certification at Missouri State University? Yes No I'm not sure. * Please list any special skills and/or experience you have. (Open Ended Question) If you have questions: Office of Human Resources (t) 417-836-5102 Monday - Friday 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. If you have student employment questions: Student Employment Services (t) 417-836-5627 Monday - Friday 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
