rent academic year? Yes No Are you a current Missouri State University Student? (Please review options carefully) No Yes. I am enrolled in 5 OR FEWER credit hours at Missouri State University Yes. I am enrolled in 6 OR MORE credit hours at Missouri State University If you have questions: Office of Human Resources (t) 417-836-5102 Monday - Friday 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. If you have student employment questions: Student Employment Services (t) 417-836-5627 Monday - Friday 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
