      "description": "Missouri State University Applicant Portal | BearPass Card Office Assistant - Work Study Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Missouri State University Office of Human Resources Part-Time Staff Positions BearPass Card Office Assistant - Work Study Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Proof of work study award is required Posting Details Posting Details Position Title BearPass Card Office Assistant - Work Study Student Status Work Study Required- You are required to be a Federal Work Study Recipient to hold this position. Work Location Springfield Campus Department Computer Svs-Systems Hiring Range 15.00 Sponsorship Information Applicants must be currently authorized to work for ANY employer in the United States on a full-time basis. This position is not eligible for work visa sponsorship. Department/Employer Operating Hours 8AM-4PM How many hours per week are required? 10 Description of Primary Duties Work shifts at the BearPass Card Office as assigned, taking photos of customers, assissting customers setting up the Digital BearPass Card and cleaning and maintaining the area. Provide good customer service to Faculty/Staff/Students. Perform clerical duties- answering the phone and emails, filing, data entry, and some cash handling. Required Qualifications Good communication skills and knowledge of general office duties such as phone etiquette, filing and general computer skills. Some cash handling experience is preferred. Must be punctual, responsible, personable and dependable. Present a good image of Missouri State University by means of a tidy appearance, a pleasant and helpful disposition and a positive attitude. Required Certifications Additional Qualifications Special Instructions to Applicants Proof of work study award is required Contact Information sstopczynski@missouristate.edu Disclaimer Disclaimer for off ca