tter (Student) Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Unofficial Transcripts - 1 Letter of Recommendation-1 (Non-confidential) Other Documents -1 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Are you currently eligible for work study (not required)? yes no Have you been informed by Student Employment that you have been awarded Work Study in the current academic year? Yes No How many credit hours are you currently enrolled in? (Open Ended Question) Are you currently seeking a degree at Missouri State University? Or are you currently seeking a teacher certification at Missouri State University? Yes No I'm not sure. Are you a current Missouri State University student? Yes No Is your cumulative and/or semester GPA a 2.5 or better? (Open Ended Question) Does your financial aid award letter show that you have a work study award for the current academic year? Yes No If you have questions: Office of Human Resources (t) 417-836-5102 Monday - Friday 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. If you have student employment questions: Student Employment Services (t) 417-836-5627 Monday - Friday 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
